WEBVTT

01:24.960 --> 01:27.800
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:35.840 --> 01:37.800
-Come again soon.
-Thank you.

01:38.600 --> 01:39.880
-Have you seen him?
-Sir, two buns, please.

01:39.960 --> 01:41.000
Sure thing.

01:43.600 --> 01:44.760
-Here you go.
-Thank you.

01:45.280 --> 01:47.680
Buns! Hot and fresh buns!

01:51.520 --> 01:53.280
-Buns!
-Two buns, please.

01:53.360 --> 01:55.920
Sure, our buns have thin skins
and big fillings.

01:56.000 --> 01:56.840
They taste amazing!

01:58.080 --> 01:58.920
Here you go.

02:02.280 --> 02:03.840
Sir, you've given me too much money!

02:21.920 --> 02:24.040
Zheng Wu…

03:04.680 --> 03:05.720
It's me.

03:16.200 --> 03:17.520
Wu…

03:17.600 --> 03:19.880
What are you wearing?
Where did you get these clothes?

03:19.960 --> 03:21.840
-Why are you dressed like this?
-Sit down.

03:22.360 --> 03:24.600
My old clothes caught too much attention,
so I changed into these.

03:24.680 --> 03:26.160
But you can't just run around like this.

03:26.240 --> 03:28.160
The whole city is after us right now.
It's really dangerous.

03:28.240 --> 03:30.640
I thought you were caught.
I was scared to death.

03:32.920 --> 03:34.120
Hurry, eat them.

03:34.680 --> 03:35.560
Where did you get the money?

03:37.160 --> 03:39.280
I sold my ring. Now, eat.

03:46.000 --> 03:49.120
You didn't need to sell it.
I've got some jewelry here too.

03:52.080 --> 03:53.480
Use it for travel expenses.

03:58.000 --> 04:01.600
We just need to get through tonight.
The city gates will open tomorrow.

04:03.480 --> 04:05.880
Eat now. We need to conserve our strength.

04:08.840 --> 04:11.400
-You eat some too.
-I already ate on my way here.

04:16.440 --> 04:18.079
I saw him hide inside.

04:41.440 --> 04:43.080
-Go report it right now!
-Got it.

04:50.880 --> 04:52.760
Inspector Zhang, there's movement
at the Zheng household.

04:52.840 --> 04:54.760
Two carriages left the Zheng house.

04:54.840 --> 04:57.640
One wandered around the city.
The other went into Lotus Lane.

04:58.200 --> 05:00.400
Quickly, gather the troops and follow me!

05:01.000 --> 05:01.840
Yes, sir!

05:05.040 --> 05:06.640
Inspector Zhang,
something happened in the prison.

05:06.720 --> 05:07.880
What happened?

05:07.960 --> 05:11.040
Mr. Wang forcibly took away Mr. Xu.
He had an imperial token.

05:11.120 --> 05:12.040
What?

05:25.040 --> 05:27.800
Mr. Wang, where are you heading?

05:27.880 --> 05:30.400
Zhang Jinran, what are you trying to do?

05:30.480 --> 05:31.480
VIRTUE SURPASSES MATERIAL TREASURE

05:31.560 --> 05:35.240
I was ordered to summon Xu Nanying,

05:35.320 --> 05:39.040
yet you've privately
mobilized soldiers to stop me.

05:39.120 --> 05:40.960
Do you still respect the imperial laws?

05:41.040 --> 05:44.000
His Majesty has granted me
the authority to command troops.

05:44.520 --> 05:46.200
I should be asking you.

05:46.280 --> 05:48.960
Where did you get the nerve
to privately use guards

05:49.040 --> 05:51.240
and oppress me,
the Inspector of Huainandao?

05:51.320 --> 05:52.360
Insolence!

05:53.280 --> 05:54.480
Let's see who dares to act!

05:54.560 --> 05:56.680
You've trespassed
into the Grand Governor's Office.

05:57.280 --> 05:58.400
Why wouldn't I dare?

05:59.960 --> 06:01.640
Open your eyes.

06:02.160 --> 06:04.200
The seal of the Court of Judicial Review
is here!

06:04.280 --> 06:05.440
Who dares make a move?

06:05.520 --> 06:07.640
The Court of Judicial Review
does not oversee me.

06:08.160 --> 06:10.600
I won't question
where you got that seal from.

06:10.680 --> 06:13.840
Leave now, and I'll let this slide.

06:13.920 --> 06:16.920
Otherwise,
we won't just detain Xu Nanying!

06:18.000 --> 06:21.680
Today, I must take Xu Nanying away.

06:21.760 --> 06:23.920
Kill anyone who stops me!

06:29.480 --> 06:31.080
An imperial decree has arrived!

06:37.560 --> 06:38.960
"The Emperor decrees.

06:41.920 --> 06:44.600
To Zhang Jinran, Inspector of Huainandao,
tasked with overseeing Yangzhou,

06:44.680 --> 06:46.720
correcting misconduct,
and removing corruption.

06:46.800 --> 06:49.160
Previously, you reported
Xu Nanying of Yangzhou's Governor's Office

06:49.240 --> 06:50.920
for bribery and abuse of power.

06:51.000 --> 06:52.800
This weighs heavily on my heart.

06:52.880 --> 06:53.760
Despite Xu's high position,

06:53.840 --> 06:56.240
the grievances of the people
cannot be ignored.

06:56.320 --> 06:58.520
I hereby grant you the authorit
y to preside over this case."

06:58.600 --> 07:01.760
I, Zhang Jinran, accept the decree!

07:15.080 --> 07:16.400
What's wrong, Mr. Wang?

07:17.720 --> 07:20.440
Do you feel dissatisfied
with this imperial decree?

07:21.920 --> 07:22.840
I wouldn't dare.

07:25.320 --> 07:26.280
Inspector Zhang,

07:27.720 --> 07:31.680
His Majesty's decree only permits you
to preside over Xu Nanying's case.

07:32.760 --> 07:35.640
Don't think you can act recklessly.

07:35.720 --> 07:37.360
Let me tell you this.

07:38.000 --> 07:41.840
If I can impeach Xu Nanying,
I can impeach you too.

07:43.200 --> 07:44.280
Take Xu Nanying back!

08:02.560 --> 08:03.560
Shijiu!

08:05.840 --> 08:06.920
Shijiu!

08:18.320 --> 08:19.360
Father.

08:19.880 --> 08:22.160
You still dare to call me Father?

08:25.920 --> 08:26.920
Where is it?

08:27.880 --> 08:29.040
Father,

08:30.840 --> 08:32.400
I'll give you the beryl stone.

08:32.919 --> 08:34.200
Just let us go.

08:34.280 --> 08:36.880
So, this was your plan all along?

08:37.480 --> 08:39.080
To steal the funds and run away?

08:42.760 --> 08:43.840
Zheng Wu,

08:44.680 --> 08:47.320
I raised you as the family heir

08:48.520 --> 08:50.920
and planned everything for you.

08:51.760 --> 08:55.040
Yet for this woman,
you heartlessly betrayed me!

08:55.120 --> 08:58.200
Are you being fair to me,
fair to the Zheng family?

08:58.920 --> 09:00.800
This has nothing to do with Cui Shijiu.

09:01.680 --> 09:02.960
Let her go.

09:04.280 --> 09:07.440
I'll take full responsibility
for everything.

09:07.520 --> 09:09.080
Can you even bear the consequences?

09:10.120 --> 09:11.960
When you did this,

09:13.560 --> 09:15.680
did you think about your mother?

09:16.280 --> 09:17.360
Mother?

09:18.200 --> 09:19.400
Where is Mother?

09:20.480 --> 09:23.720
If your mother saw you like this,

09:26.960 --> 09:29.080
how heartbroken would she be?

09:30.720 --> 09:32.000
You know very well,

09:32.520 --> 09:36.120
her greatest wish was for you
to lead the Zheng family!

09:36.640 --> 09:37.920
You're wrong.

09:38.680 --> 09:41.720
All she ever wanted
was for me to be safe and happy.

09:42.600 --> 09:43.840
Foolish child!

09:51.000 --> 09:52.080
Zheng Wu,

09:56.080 --> 09:57.600
come with me.

09:59.760 --> 10:02.040
I will arrange your escape route.

10:03.120 --> 10:04.120
Father,

10:06.520 --> 10:09.880
what are you planning to do with me?

10:13.040 --> 10:16.360
Well… Isn't this a ready-made fall guy?

10:17.080 --> 10:20.400
When Prince Ying arrives,
I'll find a way to clear your name.

10:21.440 --> 10:24.480
Zheng Wu, at this critical moment,

10:25.520 --> 10:28.240
don't let emotions
cloud your judgment. Act!

10:32.680 --> 10:33.720
Father,

10:34.360 --> 10:35.920
I would rather die

10:37.280 --> 10:39.320
than let anyone hurt Cui Shijiu.

10:39.920 --> 10:42.440
Zheng Wu, I know you can't do it,

10:42.520 --> 10:43.840
so I'll do it for you.

10:45.080 --> 10:45.920
Master!

10:52.440 --> 10:54.800
You dare hurt your father?

10:55.960 --> 10:57.280
You've lost your mind!

10:57.360 --> 10:58.680
I told you,

10:59.480 --> 11:01.280
no one touches Cui Shijiu today!

11:02.160 --> 11:03.120
Zheng Wu,

11:03.200 --> 11:07.000
you are now the Zheng family's only heir,
the future of this family.

11:07.080 --> 11:09.760
Are you going to destroy yourself
over this woman?

11:09.840 --> 11:12.200
Zheng Si was also the family heir.

11:12.280 --> 11:14.120
How did he die?

11:14.200 --> 11:16.960
We were nothing but pawns in your game!

11:17.040 --> 11:19.480
-Pawns!
-What nonsense are you spouting?

11:19.560 --> 11:21.680
You and Zheng Si are my sons!

11:22.400 --> 11:24.640
I am your father!

11:24.720 --> 11:25.960
We're family!

11:26.040 --> 11:30.240
-How could I harm you?
-A family like this is not worth keeping!

11:30.840 --> 11:34.760
I am Zheng Zhiheng,
and I will no longer live for this family.

11:35.840 --> 11:37.120
This time,

11:38.800 --> 11:40.880
I will live for myself.

11:44.920 --> 11:46.880
How could you be so selfish?

11:47.600 --> 11:49.840
You disobey me,

11:49.920 --> 11:53.120
just to carry the label of a criminal
and run forever?

11:53.200 --> 11:56.320
Do you think you can escape Yangzhou?

11:57.520 --> 11:58.960
If I can't escape,

12:00.080 --> 12:01.200
then I won't run.

12:02.160 --> 12:04.800
You're the one
who's committed countless crimes.

12:05.320 --> 12:07.960
You're the one who colluded with bandits.

12:08.040 --> 12:10.400
You're the one who sold stolen goods.

12:10.480 --> 12:13.520
Why don't you confess to your crimes?

12:13.600 --> 12:16.040
Why do you always
make your son take the blame?

12:17.360 --> 12:23.320
Father, what exactly does a son
mean to you?

12:47.200 --> 12:49.280
Master!

12:54.280 --> 12:55.320
Zheng Wu…

12:58.240 --> 13:00.400
Zheng Wu… Zheng Wu…

13:00.920 --> 13:04.080
Zheng Wu!

13:05.040 --> 13:06.080
Zheng Wu…

13:07.760 --> 13:09.000
Zheng Wu…

13:09.600 --> 13:12.240
I only have you as a son.

13:13.840 --> 13:15.240
If you die,

13:16.080 --> 13:17.360
how will I live?

13:17.880 --> 13:19.080
How will I live?

13:19.920 --> 13:22.960
Open your eyes and look at me! Zheng Wu…

13:31.680 --> 13:34.480
Cui Shijiu, it's you…

13:35.000 --> 13:37.000
You killed my son!

13:38.200 --> 13:39.360
Bring me a torch.

13:40.920 --> 13:42.440
Bring me a torch!

13:42.520 --> 13:43.360
Torch!

13:43.880 --> 13:46.320
Master, the officers are here!

13:46.400 --> 13:49.680
Cui Shijiu, my son can't die in vain.

13:49.760 --> 13:51.200
You'll accompany him in death!

13:55.200 --> 13:57.680
The officers are here.
We must leave, Master!

13:58.200 --> 14:00.000
If we don't go now, it'll be too late!

14:00.080 --> 14:02.960
Master! Go now!

14:03.040 --> 14:05.920
Burn everything here! Hurry!

14:06.000 --> 14:07.240
Master, let's go!

15:14.160 --> 15:15.400
Shijiu…

15:40.520 --> 15:41.880
I'm here for you…

15:57.600 --> 16:00.760
Zheng Wu! Zheng Wu! You won't die!

16:00.840 --> 16:02.760
-You won't die!
-Shijiu…

16:02.840 --> 16:04.040
Shijiu…

16:04.560 --> 16:06.880
Listen to me… Listen to me…

16:07.400 --> 16:08.640
Don't speak.

16:09.160 --> 16:10.560
You must go.

16:11.480 --> 16:13.560
I… I can't make it.

16:15.480 --> 16:18.880
You need to go. There's no time left…

16:18.960 --> 16:19.920
Go now…

16:20.440 --> 16:21.520
Leave!

16:22.040 --> 16:23.080
Don't speak.

16:25.000 --> 16:25.840
Shijiu!

16:26.440 --> 16:27.800
It's too late…

16:27.880 --> 16:29.640
Don't talk. Let's go.

16:29.720 --> 16:30.960
We'll go together.

16:36.880 --> 16:38.640
We'll leave together. Together…

16:38.720 --> 16:40.720
We'll be fine…

16:54.960 --> 16:55.840
This way.

17:02.720 --> 17:05.040
It's okay…

17:07.720 --> 17:08.800
Shijiu…

17:10.680 --> 17:11.640
No!

17:11.720 --> 17:13.040
-Shijiu…
-No!

17:13.119 --> 17:14.800
-Cui Shijiu…
-Don't die…

17:15.319 --> 17:17.800
-Don't die.
-Listen to me…

17:19.200 --> 17:20.440
Shijiu…

17:21.280 --> 17:24.040
Take care of my mother for me…

17:25.280 --> 17:27.400
Don't speak.

17:27.480 --> 17:29.480
Don't speak. Don't speak.

17:29.560 --> 17:33.520
I left something for you
in the other courtyard.

17:36.160 --> 17:37.120
I…

17:37.200 --> 17:40.800
I promised you something…

17:41.320 --> 17:43.480
I might not keep it…

17:44.400 --> 17:46.760
-Shijiu… Shijiu…
-Don't say it.

17:46.840 --> 17:47.760
-Shijiu…
-Don't say it.

17:47.840 --> 17:50.080
Don't die! Don't die!

17:51.280 --> 17:54.960
I want to ask you one question…

17:57.960 --> 18:02.320
Was your love for me real…?

18:24.960 --> 18:26.120
Shijiu…

18:27.200 --> 18:29.520
Shijiu…

18:31.800 --> 18:38.080
Live well…

19:10.160 --> 19:11.880
-Put out the fire!
-Yes!

19:19.120 --> 19:22.080
Mr. Zheng, please come with me
to the Grand Governor's Office.

19:24.360 --> 19:25.480
Why?

19:26.240 --> 19:29.600
Zheng Wu was found dead
in an old residence on Lotus Lane.

19:29.680 --> 19:32.120
Our people saw your carriage
entering the scene.

19:36.720 --> 19:37.960
Mr. Zheng.

19:43.120 --> 19:47.400
Zheng Wu committed a mistake
and was chased by Inspector Zhang.

19:47.480 --> 19:51.360
I tried to persuade him to surrender,
to explain everything clearly,

19:52.040 --> 19:53.360
but he wouldn't listen,

19:54.680 --> 19:56.320
and instead, he injured me.

19:57.240 --> 20:00.440
I was planning to report this
to the authorities tomorrow morning…

20:00.520 --> 20:03.080
Regardless,
since you were present at the crime scene,

20:03.160 --> 20:05.440
you must be involved in this case.

20:09.000 --> 20:10.080
Take him away.

20:16.480 --> 20:17.440
Change me into formal attire.

20:17.520 --> 20:19.000
VIRTUE SURPASSES MATERIAL TREASURE

20:21.880 --> 20:22.960
Zheng Shiyuan,

20:25.040 --> 20:27.440
how did your son Zheng Zhiheng die?

20:28.760 --> 20:31.080
I tried to persuade him
to confess and face the law,

20:32.440 --> 20:34.280
but he stabbed me with a knife.

20:35.600 --> 20:38.000
A guard of mine, in protecting me,

20:38.640 --> 20:40.520
accidentally killed him.

20:40.600 --> 20:42.360
And where is the guard now?

20:43.200 --> 20:44.640
He has committed suicide.

20:44.720 --> 20:46.280
Committed suicide?

20:47.280 --> 20:49.560
Zheng Wu was the only heir
of the Zheng family.

20:51.560 --> 20:53.360
He was filled with guilt,

20:55.160 --> 20:56.680
and I couldn't stop him.

21:01.240 --> 21:03.360
Now I must ask you, Inspector Zhang,

21:04.240 --> 21:10.400
why did you issue a warrant for my son,
forcing him to a desperate end?

21:10.480 --> 21:11.640
How dare you!

21:15.680 --> 21:17.320
Merchant Kang Ming

21:18.080 --> 21:21.360
reported that some goods
at Jubao House were stolen property.

21:21.440 --> 21:23.240
Your son Zheng Zhiheng
was involved in fencing them.

21:23.760 --> 21:28.440
And in his residence and carriages,
we found a large amount of evidence.

21:29.680 --> 21:31.480
I know nothing about this.

21:34.200 --> 21:36.160
Where did the stolen goods come from?

21:37.000 --> 21:39.200
I believe someone will know.

21:39.280 --> 21:40.120
Bring her in.

21:54.320 --> 21:55.280
Cui Shijiu.

21:56.320 --> 21:57.840
Just now, Zheng Shiyuan claimed

21:58.880 --> 22:00.800
that Zheng Zhiheng stabbed him,

22:01.760 --> 22:03.560
and his guard, in protecting him,

22:04.160 --> 22:06.400
accidentally killed Zheng Zhiheng.

22:07.280 --> 22:08.760
You were there at the scene.

22:10.880 --> 22:13.080
Is Zheng Shiyuan telling the truth?

22:31.680 --> 22:32.640
Yes.

22:41.280 --> 22:44.560
Then, were you aware that Zheng Zhiheng
was involved in fencing stolen goods?

22:46.240 --> 22:47.320
I wasn't aware.

22:56.680 --> 22:57.600
Inspector Zhang,

22:59.520 --> 23:01.280
Zheng Wu acted rashly

23:02.440 --> 23:04.560
and handled goods of unknown origin.

23:06.480 --> 23:08.280
We truly knew nothing about it.

23:11.920 --> 23:14.240
Please, Inspector Zhang,
discern the truth.

23:17.680 --> 23:19.880
However, he stole seals

23:20.400 --> 23:22.200
and misused
the Zheng family's private assets,

23:22.280 --> 23:23.560
which were not stolen.

23:23.640 --> 23:25.200
Please return them to us.

23:25.280 --> 23:28.080
Otherwise, the entire Zheng family,

23:28.160 --> 23:30.840
the hundreds of craftsmen
employed at Jubao House,

23:30.920 --> 23:33.880
and the numerous merchants
relying on our trade network

23:33.960 --> 23:35.200
will all be ruined.

23:35.280 --> 23:38.320
Yangzhou's jewelry industry
will fall into chaos.

23:38.920 --> 23:40.240
The law is strict.

23:41.000 --> 23:44.520
Stolen goods are stolen goods,
and private assets are private assets.

23:45.640 --> 23:47.520
Once the case is thoroughly investigated,

23:48.120 --> 23:49.880
they will be returned to the Zheng family.

23:49.960 --> 23:51.160
Inspector Zhang,

23:51.680 --> 23:54.400
the Zheng family might last
three to five more days,

23:55.000 --> 23:58.760
but these hundreds or thousands of people
who rely on us for their livelihoods

23:59.360 --> 24:00.840
cannot afford any delays.

24:02.520 --> 24:06.400
Could you kindly allow me to return
and handle these affairs?

24:06.480 --> 24:08.960
Whenever you need me,

24:09.640 --> 24:12.800
I will be at your service.

24:15.880 --> 24:17.760
The case is not yet resolved,

24:20.080 --> 24:22.120
and you are still a suspect.

24:23.160 --> 24:25.360
But considering
the many craftsmen in your employ,

24:26.680 --> 24:28.920
you may return to handle your affairs.

24:29.760 --> 24:31.080
However, listen carefully,

24:32.080 --> 24:34.160
you are not allowed
to step outside your private residence.

24:37.640 --> 24:39.280
Thank you, Inspector Zhang.

25:00.080 --> 25:06.760
NIGHTLESS SOUTHWEST

25:21.480 --> 25:23.200
You were there at the scene.

25:24.800 --> 25:26.200
What exactly happened?

25:47.320 --> 25:48.280
Master!

25:50.800 --> 25:52.240
Where is my Zheng Wu?

25:52.760 --> 25:53.960
Where is Zheng Wu?

25:55.600 --> 26:00.520
Master, tell me they were lying to me.

26:01.040 --> 26:02.560
Everything they said is false.

26:04.320 --> 26:08.360
Say something!

26:09.120 --> 26:11.240
Take Lady Yu back to rest.

26:25.080 --> 26:27.080
It's you!

26:27.920 --> 26:29.880
You're the one who harmed him!

26:31.080 --> 26:34.400
You committed these crimes.
Why did you take my son's life?

26:34.480 --> 26:36.320
How could you be so heartless?

26:36.400 --> 26:39.720
Give me back my son!

26:39.800 --> 26:41.280
Bring back my son!

26:45.000 --> 26:46.200
Zheng Wu is gone.

26:47.600 --> 26:49.280
I feel the same pain as you.

26:50.600 --> 26:53.080
But if you dare spout nonsense again,

26:55.160 --> 26:57.480
don't blame me for being ruthless.

26:57.560 --> 26:58.600
Take her away!

27:17.680 --> 27:19.000
Zheng Zhiheng is dead?

27:23.440 --> 27:26.640
People often say,
"Blood is thicker than water."

27:27.360 --> 27:29.040
I never expected
Zheng Shiyuan to be this cruel.

27:29.640 --> 27:33.160
Back then, Zheng Zhixing
also died mysteriously in prison.

27:33.240 --> 27:36.800
For some people,
profit matters more than anything,

27:37.360 --> 27:38.760
even more than family.

27:42.360 --> 27:43.800
Truly, the human heart is unpredictable.

27:43.880 --> 27:46.680
But Cui Shijiu escaped the flames.

27:47.200 --> 27:50.240
She must know something,
yet she refuses to reveal it.

27:53.800 --> 27:55.200
Zheng Zhiheng is dead.

27:57.840 --> 27:59.040
As for Cui Shijiu…

28:40.080 --> 28:43.640
ZHENLANG PAVILION

29:59.600 --> 30:00.720
Still awake?

30:02.280 --> 30:03.440
I'm just thinking about something.

30:04.440 --> 30:05.680
What are you thinking about?

30:09.400 --> 30:12.440
I'm thinking about the past.

30:16.120 --> 30:17.120
You know what?

30:17.640 --> 30:21.560
That shop on the street corner,
Zhang's Fabric Store,

30:22.080 --> 30:23.280
was once owned by the Yan family.

30:24.880 --> 30:26.800
Back in the day,
Yan family thrived in Yangzhou

30:27.560 --> 30:29.240
through business.

30:29.320 --> 30:30.720
We owned seven stores at one point.

30:30.800 --> 30:33.560
People even came all the way
from Chang'an because of our reputation.

30:35.800 --> 30:38.360
Although those stores look different now,

30:39.200 --> 30:40.920
I can recognize them at a glance.

30:43.200 --> 30:45.200
And that street in front of Clear Mind,

30:46.560 --> 30:47.800
when I was a child,

30:48.520 --> 30:50.520
my mother always took me there to play.

30:51.440 --> 30:55.040
My father would carry me on his shoulders.

30:58.160 --> 31:00.600
Back then, my mother
never let me eat sweet things.

31:00.680 --> 31:02.240
I never understood why.

31:04.240 --> 31:05.680
But as I grew older,

31:07.880 --> 31:08.800
I understood even less.

31:08.880 --> 31:12.400
Why are you suddenly recalling
the happy times of childhood?

31:20.840 --> 31:22.320
Because I'm not done with revenge yet.

31:25.640 --> 31:27.120
But now,

31:29.600 --> 31:31.040
you are also something
that makes me happy.

31:38.120 --> 31:39.280
What about you?

31:39.360 --> 31:42.240
Would you risk everything
to avenge Shrimp and the others?

31:42.320 --> 31:43.160
I would.

31:43.680 --> 31:46.280
If given the chance,
I would never let Li Kui go.

31:46.360 --> 31:48.600
But people aren't meant
to live for hatred.

31:49.360 --> 31:51.880
I know I shouldn't tell you
to let go of your hatred,

31:55.360 --> 31:58.160
but life goes on.

32:00.600 --> 32:01.680
Still,

32:03.720 --> 32:05.080
you should live your own life.

32:07.320 --> 32:10.400
Have you thought about what you'd do

32:11.480 --> 32:12.720
if your revenge is fulfilled?

32:15.000 --> 32:17.480
Have you thought about
making a home here in Yangzhou,

32:19.200 --> 32:21.280
strolling through its streets,

32:22.440 --> 32:24.120
and watching the lights of homes?

32:30.080 --> 32:31.840
My whole life, honestly,

32:33.000 --> 32:34.680
has been focused solely on revenge.

32:35.800 --> 32:37.560
I've lived just to avenge.

32:40.640 --> 32:41.680
So,

32:45.520 --> 32:47.200
could I really live that kind of life?

33:03.760 --> 33:04.960
I'll be with you.

33:13.840 --> 33:15.120
Alright.

33:50.080 --> 33:52.320
Don't catch a cold, silly.

34:05.360 --> 34:12.360
Don't go…

34:17.199 --> 34:18.480
What's wrong with you?

34:19.120 --> 34:20.440
Where am I going?

34:22.000 --> 34:23.000
Oh, right…

34:23.800 --> 34:25.360
I'm really going to take you somewhere,

34:26.560 --> 34:30.280
a place just for the two of us.

34:32.800 --> 34:34.199
Once we get there,

34:34.920 --> 34:38.520
there will no longer be Zheng Wu
and no longer Cui Shijiu.

34:39.440 --> 34:42.280
We can live a life of our own.

34:43.239 --> 34:46.239
By then,
you'll have to give me a big, healthy boy.

34:46.760 --> 34:48.800
No, wait, also a girl,

34:48.880 --> 34:50.000
one who looks like you…

35:18.440 --> 35:19.760
Zhuohua…

35:22.080 --> 35:23.520
Your name is Cui Zhuohua.

35:24.920 --> 35:26.120
You're more than just Cui Shijiu.

35:28.560 --> 35:29.560
Remember that.

36:06.520 --> 36:08.280
Yan Zijing and Su Muzhe

36:08.360 --> 36:10.920
conspired to take Zheng Wu's life.

36:12.920 --> 36:15.360
This is a slap to the face
of the Zheng family!

36:15.440 --> 36:19.760
If I don't avenge this,
I, Zheng Shiyuan, am unworthy as a father!

36:22.080 --> 36:27.560
If any of you can take their lives,
I'll reward you handsomely!

36:36.400 --> 36:38.680
-You, go!
-Master, I can't do it.

36:41.080 --> 36:44.400
What? Is there no one capable
in my Zheng family?

36:45.920 --> 36:48.560
Useless! A bunch of useless fools!

36:50.760 --> 36:52.080
Get up!

36:53.320 --> 36:54.200
You, go!

36:54.280 --> 36:56.320
Master, I can't do it…

36:56.400 --> 36:57.760
Why can't you?

37:07.840 --> 37:09.120
All these years,

37:09.640 --> 37:13.440
I've done so much for you.
If not for merit, at least for the effort.

37:13.520 --> 37:15.280
Why would you do that?

37:15.800 --> 37:16.960
Mr. Zheng,

37:18.320 --> 37:20.160
I was helping you.

37:22.520 --> 37:25.640
If we could stall until Prince Ying
arrives, I could still see him.

37:25.720 --> 37:26.680
Perhaps,

37:28.680 --> 37:30.680
Zheng Wu still has a sliver of hope.

37:31.560 --> 37:34.640
So… you're only fit to be a guild head.

37:36.080 --> 37:38.640
At least I wouldn't lose my son

37:38.720 --> 37:41.320
or end up like a stray dog!

37:41.840 --> 37:44.880
Do you realize if not for my decision,

37:45.480 --> 37:48.400
where would your Zheng family be now?

37:49.240 --> 37:51.600
If the situation
hadn't spiraled out of control,

37:51.680 --> 37:54.080
would Prince Ying
have come to Yangzhou himself?

37:54.600 --> 37:57.680
Do you really think
everything Zhang Jinran did

37:57.760 --> 38:00.560
was just aimed at your Zheng family?

38:07.440 --> 38:09.400
I can't touch Zhang Jinran,

38:10.440 --> 38:12.240
and I can't move Yan Zijing either.

38:12.320 --> 38:14.960
We'll find their weakness

38:15.640 --> 38:17.720
and take our time to plan.

38:49.720 --> 38:51.800
Inspector Zhang of Huainandao
issued an announcement to the city.

38:51.880 --> 38:53.400
Xu Nanying, an official of Yangzhou,

38:53.480 --> 38:55.160
will stand trial tomorrow
for embezzlement.

38:55.240 --> 38:56.760
NOTICE: XU NANYING COLLUDED
WITH THE BLACK DRAGON BANDITS…

38:56.840 --> 38:58.240
THE TRIAL FOR XU NANYING'S CASE
WILL BE HELD TOMORROW

38:58.320 --> 39:02.720
Zhang Jinran, my health is poor,

39:03.240 --> 39:04.560
and yet you still hold this trial?

39:04.640 --> 39:08.640
The Qionghua Festival songstress auction
raised millions,

39:08.720 --> 39:11.840
but only half a million was used
to repair the ancestral shrine.

39:11.920 --> 39:13.560
Where did the rest of the money go?

39:13.640 --> 39:18.280
I wasn't responsible
for managing those funds.

39:18.800 --> 39:20.480
How would I know?

39:20.560 --> 39:21.680
Then let me tell you.

39:21.760 --> 39:25.000
The auction money was found
in your secret chamber.

39:25.640 --> 39:26.920
How do you explain that?

39:27.000 --> 39:28.760
No one caught me red-handed.

39:28.840 --> 39:30.240
Then let me ask you this.

39:30.920 --> 39:34.120
You closed Yan's Zhenlang Pavilion
on charges of fraud,

39:34.880 --> 39:36.760
faked the inventory records,

39:36.840 --> 39:39.440
and pocketed all the seized gold,

39:39.520 --> 39:41.280
silver, and jewels.

39:41.360 --> 39:43.000
How do you explain that?

39:43.920 --> 39:44.840
Where's the evidence?

39:44.920 --> 39:46.880
Someone, read the ledger.

39:48.160 --> 39:51.120
The treasury vault is two zhang high,
two zhang wide,

39:51.200 --> 39:54.600
and ten zhang deep.
Inside are 100 chests of green coins,

39:54.680 --> 39:57.600
each chest containing 100 strings of cash,
ten boxes of jewels,

39:57.680 --> 39:59.360
three boxes of gem-studded ornaments,

39:59.440 --> 40:02.560
four boxes of white jade ornaments,
and pearls…

40:05.840 --> 40:06.960
Zhang Jinran,

40:07.960 --> 40:09.440
with just these,

40:10.560 --> 40:12.000
you think you can convict me?

40:12.080 --> 40:14.680
You embezzled and abused
your power for personal gain.

40:15.200 --> 40:16.840
Isn't this evidence enough?

40:17.560 --> 40:19.320
Any official overseeing finances

40:19.400 --> 40:21.360
who extorts wealt
h from those under their authority

40:21.880 --> 40:25.480
shall not only be dismissed
but stripped of their title.

40:25.560 --> 40:28.360
From now on, you are removed from office,

40:28.880 --> 40:32.240
and the Xu family
will no longer hold the status of gentry.

40:33.640 --> 40:35.360
Zhang Jinran!

40:35.960 --> 40:37.160
Xu Nanying,

40:39.040 --> 40:41.160
if you want a reduced sentence,

40:43.040 --> 40:45.360
confess what you know as soon as possible.

40:47.760 --> 40:49.160
Keep dreaming.

40:50.920 --> 40:52.600
I know nothing,

40:53.560 --> 40:55.680
and I'll say nothing.

41:00.720 --> 41:01.840
Senior,

41:05.000 --> 41:06.640
I truly wanted to help you,

41:08.240 --> 41:10.280
but since you're like this, so be it.

41:18.480 --> 41:20.720
Duanwu, we're not opening today?

41:21.720 --> 41:23.920
An important guest is coming.
No business today.

41:24.000 --> 41:25.720
Important guest? Who?

41:26.320 --> 41:27.520
You'll know when they arrive.

41:29.240 --> 41:30.440
I have big news to share.

41:30.520 --> 41:32.360
The deal is finalized!

41:34.360 --> 41:36.400
From now on,
we'll own four shops in Yangzhou!

41:36.480 --> 41:37.960
Really? Let me see!

41:38.840 --> 41:41.320
Starting today,
the two of you should start thinking

41:41.400 --> 41:43.640
about which shop you'd like to manage.

41:46.760 --> 41:49.520
-Of course, I'll stay at Clear Mind.
-I get to be a manager now?

41:49.600 --> 41:51.240
Then you'll be working under me
from now on.

41:52.600 --> 41:54.160
Duanwu!

41:55.640 --> 41:57.560
-Mr. Zhang!
-I'll handle this…

41:57.640 --> 41:58.920
Congratulations!

41:59.000 --> 42:02.360
Back in Hepu,
you told me you wanted to be a peddler.

42:02.440 --> 42:03.920
Now, you've finally achieved your dream.

42:04.000 --> 42:06.200
And you've created
a new world of your own.

42:06.280 --> 42:09.360
Whether a peddler or a shopkeeper,
it's all the best.

42:11.080 --> 42:12.200
Mr. Zhang, please.

42:13.040 --> 42:14.080
Alright.

42:18.640 --> 42:21.840
The broader the world,
the greater the freedom.

42:21.920 --> 42:24.520
Of course, I also believe
your ambitions won't stop at Yangzhou.

42:24.600 --> 42:26.120
I'll take that as a blessing from you.

42:26.200 --> 42:27.520
Thank you!

42:28.600 --> 42:29.920
You've thanked him already.

42:30.440 --> 42:31.520
What about me?

42:34.880 --> 42:36.680
Of course, I need to thank you properly.

42:36.760 --> 42:38.800
As for the money from the beryl deal,

42:39.320 --> 42:41.160
I'll hand it over
as soon as I have it all together.

42:41.680 --> 42:43.520
But I have an idea.

42:43.600 --> 42:46.080
-Do you want to hear it?
-Sure.

42:47.760 --> 42:50.520
How about the beryl money

42:51.920 --> 42:53.240
becomes an investment in Clear Mind?

42:53.320 --> 42:55.160
You won't lose.

42:58.440 --> 42:59.760
So, not only do you refuse
to repay the money,

42:59.840 --> 43:00.840
but you also want to be my boss?

43:00.920 --> 43:03.720
I see you've got nowhere to go,

43:04.360 --> 43:06.800
so why not stay at Clear Mind?

43:09.040 --> 43:12.240
The money's gone, the goods are gone,
and now I'm stuck doing chores for you?

43:12.320 --> 43:14.400
You really know how to work the angles.

43:17.280 --> 43:18.200
It's up to you.

43:20.160 --> 43:21.800
Alright, I'll think about it.

43:23.280 --> 43:24.360
Ms. Su!

43:25.040 --> 43:26.360
The guest has arrived.

43:26.440 --> 43:27.440
He's here.

43:27.520 --> 43:28.880
Let's go greet him!
